  "idea": "Greenshot: lightweight screenshot utility with instant annotation tools",
  "text": "Highlight key buttons, blur sensitive client data, and add numbered callouts instantly. Sharing raw screenshots across team channels accidentally exposes client passwords, API tokens, and billing information. Default screenshot utilities lack built-in obfuscation tools, forcing risky manual exports or slow third-party photo editing. Greenshot instantly redacts private credentials with a pixelate drag and stamps auto-incrementing numbered markers over workflow steps. You protect client security while delivering flawless team documentation.",
